#. module: gts_coa_hierarchy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:gts_coa_hierarchy.field_account_account__type
msgid "Account Type Hie."
msgstr "Tipo"

#. module: gts_coa_hierarchy
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gts_coa_hierarchy.field_account_account__type
msgid ""
"The 'Internal Type' is used for features available on different types of "
"accounts: view can not have journal items, consolidation are accounts that "
"can have children accounts for multi-company consolidations, "
"payable/receivable are for partners accounts (for debit/credit computations), "
"closed for depreciated accounts."
msgstr ""
"El 'Tipo Interno' se utiliza para características disponibles en diferentes "
"tipos de cuentas: vista no puede tener elementos de diario, consolidación son "
"cuentas que pueden tener cuentas hijas para consolidaciones multi-empresa, "
"por pagar/por cobrar son para cuentas de socios (para cálculos de "
"débito/crédito), cerrada para cuentas depreciadas."

